## FAQ

**Is this a real property listing?**  
No — this is a demo tool built to showcase our chatbot architecture. All property data is simulated for demonstration purposes.

**Can I integrate this with my CRM?**  
Yes. We build production chatbots that push leads via webhook to any CRM (HubSpot, Salesforce, Airtable, Zoho, or custom integrations). The lead payload is structured JSON ready for any pipeline.

**What data do you collect?**  
Only the lead details you enter (name, phone, email, inspection preference). We never sell data. See our [Privacy Policy](/privacy) for full details.
